False charge 248. Whoever, with intent to cause injury to any person, institutes or causes to be of offence instituted any criminal proceeding against that person, or falsely charges any person with made with intent to having committed an offence, knowing that there is no just or lawful ground for such injure. proceeding or charge against that person,
(a) shall be punished with imprisonment of either description for a term which may extend to five years, or with fine which may extend to two lakh rupees, or with both;
