Escape from 261. Whoever, being a public servant legally bound as such public servant to keep confinement in confinement any person charged with or convicted of any offence or lawfully committed or custody to custody, negligently suffers such person to escape from confinement, shall be punished negligently suffered by with simple imprisonment for a term which may extend to two years, or with fine, or with public servant. both.
